SUMMARY:[ATH] VolunTEEN Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T190000
DTSTAMP:20260811T142013Z
UID:smcl-6a6d088e0d65ac360043966b@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Need some volunteer hours but don’t have a lot of time to co
 mmit? High school students can drop in to our library to help us with task
 s such as program prep\, display help\, and research tasks. It’s a fun a
 nd easy way to make a difference in your community while hanging out with 
 your friends.  \n\nCheck in with us at the Front Desk to be matched with a
  volunteer task every last Monday of the month between 6-7 PM. We’ll vou
 ch for your time well spent!\n\nAges: 12-18\nRegistration: none\nSource: h
 ttps://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a6d088e0d65ac360043966b\nLast synced
 : 2026-08-11 07:20 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a6d088e0d65ac360043966b
END:VEVENT
