BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[WS] Service Learning: Preparing for Fall
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260901T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260901T120000
DTSTAMP:20260811T142013Z
UID:filoli-22052@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Filoli’s Service Learning program invites the local communit
 y to help care for the historic Estate. Working alongside Filoli’s Horti
 culture Team\, volunteers will take part in meaningful garden projects suc
 h as harvesting plant materials for fall displays and donations\, weeding 
 to prepare beds\, and laying or refreshing mulch in areas like the cutting
  and vegetable gardens.\n\nTickets: Free\; reservation required.\n\nPartic
 ipants receive free admission to Filoli on the day of the program.\n\nAges
 : All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/service-learning-preparing-fo
 r-fall/2026-09-01/\nLast synced: 2026-08-11 07:20 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/service-learning-preparing-for-fall/2026-09-0
 1/
END:VEVENT
